OL,3,ADeaths in detention cells in Nigeria
OL,4,Awere entirely preventable, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn inquiry into the deaths of 33
OL,8,Fdetainees in Nigeria's Minna state has
OL,9,Ffound they died as a result of severe
OL,10,Fovercrowding, poor ventilation and
OL,11,Ffailure by officers to respond to
OL,12,Fdistress calls.
OL,14,FForensic and medical evidence showed
OL,15,Fthe "entirely preventable" deaths had
OL,16,Fresulted from acute respiratory failure
OL,17,Flinked to prolonged confinement,
OL,18,Faggravated by heat stress and
OL,19,Fdehydration.
OL,21,FThe evidence did not support initial
OL,22,Fclaims of a disease outbreak.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
