OL,3,ADeaths in detention cells in Nigeria
OL,4,Awere entirely preventable, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe detainees were found dead on 17
OL,8,FSeptember while being held by the
OL,9,FNigeria Security and Civil Defence
OL,10,FCorps on suspicion of illegal mining.
OL,11,FThe investigation found that the mining
OL,12,Fsites had been licensed.
